---
// Phones: the slim bar pinned to the top (it never hides): one row of chips that scrolls sideways, "🕒 ▾" (Cuándo: a
// menu with one date at a time) and the view's event types, each chosen with one tap (scripts/views/filters.ts fills
// it, whenMenu.ts opens the menu). Under it, only while filtering, "12 eventos · Finde, Salsa" and "× Limpiar": what's
// chosen in the "Filtros" sheet without a chip of its own (a rhythm, "Sin bares") is named there. Search, Guardados and
// the "Filtros" sheet are in the bar at the bottom (BottomNav.astro).
---

<div class="jump-bar" id="jump-bar" role="region" aria-label="Filtros" hidden>
  <div class="container jump-bar__inner">
    <div class="jump-bar__chips" id="jump-chips" role="group" aria-label="Filtros rápidos"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="when-menu" id="when-menu" role="menu" aria-label="Cuándo" hidden></div>
  <div class="container filter-summary" id="jump-summary" hidden></div>
</div>
